From: Eurus <56497078+Eurus7895@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 02:59:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add organization profile and community health
 defaults

GitHub applies community health files from an organization's public
.github repository to every repository that lacks its own, and shows
profile/README.md on the organization page.

Add the profile, a contributing guide (branches, Conventional Commits,
no-reply commit identity, no tool attribution), a security policy that
routes reports to private vulnerability reporting, bug and feature
issue forms, and a pull request template that keeps the why, the
changes, the decisions and the validation apart.
